            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><i class="fa-solid fa-check text-rose-600 mt-1"></i> Hashtag and caption generation</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><i class="fa-solid fa-check text-rose-600 mt-1"></i> Multi-format video creation</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-amber-50 to-white border p-8 rounded-3xl hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all">
