            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><i class="fa-solid fa-check text-amber-600 mt-1"></i> Brand voice consistency</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><i class="fa-solid fa-check text-amber-600 mt-1"></i> Emotional engagement optimization</li>
