        <h3 class="text-3xl font-semibold text-center mb-10">Benefits of AI Video Generation</h3>
        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-4 gap-8">
          <div class="text-center">
            <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-white/10 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4">
              <i class="fa-solid fa-bolt text-3xl text-sky-400"></i>
            </div>
            <h4 class="font-semibold mb-2">Speed & Efficiency</h4>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-300">Create videos 10x faster than traditional methods</p>
